The legislative texts in this repository are from the state legal information system "Законодательство России"
(http://ips.pravo.gov.ru), part of the Official Internet Portal of Legal Information (pravo.gov.ru). Under article
1259(6)(1) of the Civil Code of the Russian Federation, official documents of state bodies, including laws and other
normative acts, are not objects of copyright. The texts are reproduced without change to their wording.
Source: Официальный интернет-портал правовой информации (www.pravo.gov.ru).

